Why this row exists: CQ-V01 (task-bde86540…) landed in dc13b0e, plus QA's one-line test fix in d8f2d6e. That is 448 net LOC across 9 daemon files, over QA's 400-net-LOC cap. The human rejected the size waiver twice (prop-3f2fd69a, prop-162240df). QA passed V01 on substance, so the route is to split REVIEW SCOPE, not bytes:
